Notice for internal/grammar

Each subdirectory of this directory has the parse tables and the lexer rules
of one jison grammar of mermaid 12.2.0, and a file actions.js.txt. The
script tools/reference/gen-jison.mjs writes these files. It runs jison
0.4.18 on the grammar files of mermaid.

  tables.go, lexactions_gen.go
      The tables that jison makes from the grammar, as Go data.
  actions.js.txt
      The JavaScript of the semantic actions and the lexer actions of the
      grammar, copied from the grammar file of mermaid. The 19 files with
      this name are text for the reader. No program reads them.
  lexactions_manual.go
      A Go port of lexer actions of the grammar.

The grammar files are code of mermaid (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid).
